<p>Hello Principal ,<br />
<br />
My name is Wes Haynes and I work with the American Red Cross. &nbsp;We have a program used across the country called &quot;Pint Sized Heroes.&quot; &nbsp;In short, we partner with Elementary schools to provide a short curriculum to students and then work with them and the school to host a blood drive for the parents and faculty. &nbsp;All students who recruit an adult to donate will also earn a thank you present from the Red Cross.<br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:calibri,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">I&rsquo;ll be in your area next week and would like 15 minutes to talk with you or a designee about the program.&nbsp; Please let me know when you could be available.</span></span><br />
<br />
I&#39;ve attached a short flier and here is a link to a video that is shorter than 2 minutes.</p>

<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1fTXsmcUi7U&amp;feature=youtu.be (you might need to copy and paste)<br />
<br />
Thank you for your time and consideration.&nbsp;<br />
